      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5fca8aeffacfd6007656bf65/9af2a4f1-6b52-480b-a69f-d59b265be598/16",
       "24x24": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5fca8aeffacfd6007656bf65/9af2a4f1-6b52-480b-a69f-d59b265be598/24",
       "32x32": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5fca8aeffacfd6007656bf65/9af2a4f1-6b52-480b-a69f-d59b265be598/32",
       "48x48": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5fca8aeffacfd6007656bf65/9af2a4f1-6b52-480b-a69f-d59b265be598/48"
      },
      "displayName": "Esmé Cowles",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=5fca8aeffacfd6007656bf65",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "I believe this is fixed by ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "attrs": {
             "href": "https://github.com/fcrepo4-labs/fcrepo-import-export/pull/90"
            },
            "type": "link"
           }
          ],
          "text": "https://github.com/fcrepo4-labs/fcrepo-import-export/pull/90",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "The commit referenced in the ticket made the checking more strict (making sure that the subject of the triple was the resource being retrieved: ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "attrs": {
             "href": "https://github.com/fcrepo4-labs/fcrepo-import-export/commit/5240eae2bd4629f76f6fc397f8b280c1f40f4349#diff-230835395ae42488584f0706d8828ad4R343"
            },
            "type": "link"
           }
          ],
          "text": "https://github.com/fcrepo4-labs/fcrepo-import-export/commit/5240eae2bd4629f76f6fc397f8b280c1f40f4349#diff-230835395ae42488584f0706d8828ad4R343",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "text": " ).",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "But I think that was overly strict, both because trailing slashes are added and removed in different places, and because hash URIs or other subjects are possible (particularly for other impl. which might not have the single-subject requirement).  So I've removed the requirement for the subject: ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "attrs": {
             "href": "https://github.com/fcrepo4-labs/fcrepo-import-export/pull/90/files#diff-230835395ae42488584f0706d8828ad4R340"
            },
            "type": "link"
           }
          ],
          "text": "https://github.com/fcrepo4-labs/fcrepo-import-export/pull/90/files#diff-230835395ae42488584f0706d8828ad4R340",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1
     },
