  "customfield_10154": null,
  "customfield_10187": null,
  "description": "<p>If I point import-export at <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/rest/pcdm\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/rest/pcdm</a> it will recurse through the repository according to ldp:contains relationships.</p>\n\n<p>If I point it at <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/rest\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/rest</a> it will export that top container only, even though there are two resources (and many more contained within those) in that container:</p>\n\n<p>&lt;<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/rest/\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/rest/</a>&gt;<br/>\n        fedora:lastModified            \"2017-04-12T23:21:32.652Z\"^^&lt;<a href=\"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime</a>&gt; ;<br/>\n        rdf:type                       ldp:RDFSource ;<br/>\n        rdf:type                       ldp:Container ;<br/>\n        rdf:type                       ldp:BasicContainer ;<br/>\n        fedora:writable                \"true\"^^&lt;<a href=\"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean</a>&gt; ;<br/>\n        rdf:type                       fedora:RepositoryRoot ;<br/>\n        rdf:type                       fedora:Resource ;<br/>\n        rdf:type                       fedora:Container ;<br/>\n        ldp:contains                   &lt;<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/rest/pcdm\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/rest/pcdm</a>&gt; ;<br/>\n        ldp:contains                   &lt;<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/rest/baddatatest\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/rest/baddatatest</a>&gt; ;<br/>\n        fedora:hasTransactionProvider  &lt;<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/rest/fcr:tx\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/rest/fcr:tx</a>&gt; .</p>",
